  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced institutional capacities of constituents to produce, compile and use the tools provided to promote decent work</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Botswana is one of the few  (together with Namibia and South Africa) SADC Member States that are more advanced than all other countries implementing LMIS in the region. Botswana has and continues to receive ILO under the Results on 
 Enhanced institutional capacities of constituents to produce, compile and use the tools provided to promote decent work
 
ILO support  is expwected to ensure that  Botswana  strengthened her  labour market statistics, standards and information systems through improved statistical surveys and use of other statistical sources</narrative>
  </description>
